    "lawCode": "Amd §4, Chap 668 of 1977",
    "lawSection": "Volunteer Firefighters' Benefit",
    "memo": "BILL NUMBER:S4148\n\nTITLE OF BILL:\n\nAn act to amend chapter 668 of the laws of 1977, amending the\nvolunteer firefighters' benefit law, relating to disability due to\ndisease or malfunction of the heart or coronary arteries, in relation\nto extending the expiration of such provisions\n\nPURPOSE:\n\nTo extend the volunteer firefighters heart benefits.\n\nSUMMARY OF PROVISIONS:\n\nThe provisions of section two of this act shall remain in full force\nand effect to and including the thirtieth day of June [2015] 2020.\n\nJUSTIFICATION:\n\nThis bill will extend the volunteer firefighters heart benefit\ncoverage for conditions of impairment of health caused by diseases of\nthe heart that is set to expire on July 1st, 2015. This proposal would\nextend the benefit for another 5 years.\n\nLEGISLATIVE HISTORY:\n\nNew Bill\n\nFISCAL IMPLICATIONS:\n\nTo be determined.\n\nEFFECTIVE DATE:\n\nThis act shall take effect immediately.\n\n",
